---
import Platform from '../layouts/Platform.astro';
import UiIcon from './UiIcon.astro';
import { membership } from '../data/membership.mjs';
import '../styles/membership.css';
---
<Platform canonicalPath="/membership" title="Membership" description="One Digivated Membership gives you one reviewed project spotlight, full News summaries, and the full UI/UX Prompt Packet. $5 once.">
<section class="membership-page" aria-labelledby="membership-title">
  <header class="membership-heading"><p class="eyebrow">DIGIVATED MEMBERSHIP</p><h1 id="membership-title">One membership.<br/><em>Full access to member content.</em></h1><p>Get one reviewed project spotlight, full News summaries, and the complete UI/UX Prompt Packet.</p></header>
  <article class="membership-offer" aria-label="Digivated Membership offer">
    <div class="membership-offer-heading"><span class="membership-plan-label">The complete membership</span><span class="membership-once">One-time purchase</span></div>
    <div class="membership-price"><strong>${membership.priceUSD}</strong><span>USD once<br/><small>No recurring charges</small></span></div>
    <div class="membership-benefits">
      <div><span class="membership-benefit-icon"><UiIcon name="sparkle" size={22}/></span><div><h2>One project spotlight</h2><p>One featured placement is included. Submit a working project for review; it must meet Digivated’s listing rules before it goes live.</p></div></div>
      <div><span class="membership-benefit-icon"><UiIcon name="book" size={22}/></span><div><h2>Full News access</h2><p>Full source-checked briefings across AI & Tech, Markets, and Security, including verified company and ticker updates. Five recent stories are free to read.</p></div></div>
      <div><span class="membership-benefit-icon"><UiIcon name="book" size={22}/></span><div><h2>Full UI/UX Prompt Packet</h2><p>All 75 prompts, the complete prompt builder, eight workflows, eight checklists, examples, and learning material. No separate packet purchase needed.</p></div></div>
    </div>
    {membership.checkoutReady ? <a class="button primary membership-checkout" href={membership.checkoutUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get membership · $5 once <UiIcon name="external" size={17}/></a> : <><button class="button primary membership-checkout" disabled>Checking Gumroad checkout…</button><p class="membership-checkout-note" role="status">Checking the live $5 one-time Gumroad offer. If checkout is unavailable, try again shortly.</p></>}
    <p class="membership-small">Buy once through Gumroad. Verify your receipt email or license key here to unlock all member content. Checkout, receipts, and applicable taxes are handled by Gumroad.</p>
  </article>
  <div class="membership-next"><p>Browsing and submitting for ordinary directory review remain free.</p><a href="/submit-project">Share a project <UiIcon name="arrow" size={16}/></a></div>
  <section id="member-sign-in" class="membership-access" aria-labelledby="membership-access-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">ALREADY A MEMBER?</p><h2 id="membership-access-title">Unlock everything.</h2><p>After your Gumroad purchase, enter the receipt email or license key once. The same verified membership unlocks full News briefings, the complete Prompt Packet, and member content. Existing purchases continue to work.</p><p id="membership-verified" hidden>Your membership is verified. <a href="/submit-project?membership=1#project-form">Submit your included spotlight request</a>.</p></div><div><form id="founding-access-form" class="carousel-access" method="post" action="/api/founding-access"><label>Gumroad license key<input name="license" type="password" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="characters" spellcheck="false" maxlength="35"/></label><p class="quiet">or</p><label>Purchase email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254"/></label><button class="button" type="submit">Verify membership</button><p id="founding-access-status" role="status"></p></form><button class="button" id="founding-sign-out" type="button" hidden>Sign out of membership</button></div></section>
  <section class="membership-faq" aria-labelledby="membership-questions"><h2 id="membership-questions">A few useful details.</h2><details><summary>What does Membership unlock?</summary><p>One reviewed project spotlight, full News summaries, and the full UI/UX Prompt Packet. Public project discovery, free samples, and ordinary project submissions remain free.</p></details><details><summary>How do I open the Prompt Packet?</summary><p>Verify your receipt email or license key in the Membership section above, then open the Prompt Packet. You can also enter your Membership license key directly at <a href="/access">digivated.com/access</a>. You do not need to buy the Prompt Packet separately.</p></details><details><summary>Is this a subscription?</summary><p>No. Membership costs $5 USD once. There are no recurring charges or automatic renewals.</p></details><details><summary>How does the project spotlight work?</summary><p>Your membership includes one project spotlight. Sign in, then choose the membership option when submitting your project. Digivated reviews its image, description, and destination before featuring it. Projects must meet the site’s listing rules; payment does not bypass review or guarantee traffic, sales, or engagement.</p></details><details><summary>Can I read News today?</summary><p>Yes. Browse <a href="/news">five free News stories</a> now, and verify membership above for full summaries.</p></details><details id="previous-purchases"><summary>What about a previous purchase?</summary><p>Existing purchases keep their original access. <a href="/access">Open your Prompt Packet</a>, or use the membership form above. If you previously purchased a standalone promotion, <a href="/submit-project?promotion=1#project-form">submit that existing purchase for review</a>. Those products are no longer advertised for separate purchase on Digivated.</p><ul id="founding-inventory-list" hidden></ul></details></section>
</section>
<script>import '../scripts/carousel-library.js'; import '../scripts/membership-checkout.js';</script>
</Platform>
